{"strongs": "H2729", "word": "חָרַד", "translit": "cha.rad", "root": "חרגל", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "tremble, be terrified", "definition": "חָרַד verb tremble, be terrified (Assyrian —arâdu, id. , according to Dl HA 20, Pr 46 ; Arabic be bashful, shamefaced ; Late Hebrew חֲרָדָה a trembling ) — Qal Perfect וְחָרַד consecutive Isa 19:16 , חָֽרְדָה Isa 10:29 , חָרַדְתְּ 2Kgs 4:13 , חָרְדוּ 1Sam 13:7 ; 1Sam 14:15 , וְחָֽרְדוּ consecutive Ezek 26:16 ; Ezek 32:10 Imperfect יֶחֱרַד Job 37:1 , וַיֶּחֱרַד Gen 27:33 + 5 t.; יֶחְרְדוּ Hos 11:10 ; Ezek 26:18 , יֶחֶרְדוּ Hos 11:11 , יֶחֱרָ֑דוּ Amos 3:6 ; Isa 41:6 , וַיֶּחֶרְדוּ Gen 42:28 + 2 t.; Imperative חִרְדוּ Isa 32:11 — 1. tremble, quake , of a mountain Exod 19:18 — so HCT, but read חָעָם , ᵐ5 see Di ( E ); of isles Ezek 26:18 (metaphor, in fear); so Isa 41:5 ( קְצוֺת הארץ , || אִיִּים יראו ). 2. tremble , of persons under supernatural influence 1Sam 14:15 (|| חֲרָדֶה , וַתִּרְגַּז הָאָרָץ ); start, start up (out of sleep) Ruth 3:8 in mental disturbance Gen 27:33 ( J ; with accusative of congnate meaning with verb) tremble , in terror Exod 19:16 ( E ), Isa 32:11 (|| רגז ), be startled (at sound of trumpet) Amos 3:6 compare 1Kgs 1:49 (+ קום , הלך , ירא ); tremble Ezek 26:16 ; Ezek 32:10 followed by לְ = at , Job 37:1 ( לִבִּי ), be terrified , of Egypt (personified) Isa 19:16 (|| פָּחַד ), Ramah Isa 10:29 , of Saul 1Sam 28:5 subject לִבּוֺ , || ירא ). 3. be anxiously careful חָרַדְתְּ אֵלֵנוּ אתכֿל הַחֲרָדָה הַזּאֹת 2Kgs 4:13 . 4. with prepositions pregnantly = go or come trembling 1Sam 13:7 (followed by מֵאחריו ᵐ5 L We Dr ) Gen 42:28 ( E ; followed by אֶלֿ ) 1Sam 16:4 (followed by לִקְרָאתוֺ ) so 1Sam 21:2 , Hos 11:10 ( מִיָּם ) v Hos 11:11 ( מִמִּצְרַיִם ). Hiph`il Perfect הֶחֱרִיד Judg 8:12 , וְּהַחֲרַדְתִּ֫י 2Sam 17:2 Participle מַחֲרִיד Lev 6:26 + 11 t.; Infinitive construct הַחֲרִיד Ezek 30:9 ; Zech 2:4 — drive in terror, rout an army, followed by accusative Judg 8:12 ; Ezek 30:9 ; Zech 2:4 compare 2Sam 17:2 ( We proposes החרידו Hos 5:8 'setzt Benjamin in Schrecken,' for ᵑ0 אַחֲרֶיךָ ); in Participle absolute, only in ׳ וְאֵין מ ; and none shall terrify , i.e. disturb the peace of those reposing — שׁכב , שׁקט , רבץ , ישׁב , ישׁב לָבֶטַחִ — in the promised land Lev 26:6 , so after captivity Jer 30:10 = Jer 46:27 , also Ezek 34:28 ; Ezek 39:26 ; Mic 4:4 ; Zeph 3:13 of undisturbed peace of the righteous Job 11:19 peace of flocks in forsaken cities Isa 17:2 undisturbed feeding on carrion by fowl and beast Deut 28:26 ; Jer 7:33 , undisturbed prowling of lions Nah 2:12 (metaphor of Assyrians).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3101')\">BDB3101</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2729')\">H2729</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3100')\">BDB3100</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3102')\">BDB3102</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָרַד</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>tremble, be terrified</highlightword> (Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>—arâdu, id.</highlight></transliteration>, according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>HA 20, Pr 46</sup></lookup>; Arabic <placeholder1958/> <highlight>be bashful, shamefaced</highlight>; Late Hebrew <bdbheb>חֲרָדָה</bdbheb> <highlight>a trembling</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וְחָרַד</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Isa 19:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,16)\">Isa 19:16</ref>, <bdbheb>חָֽרְדָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:29\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,29)\">Isa 10:29</ref>, <bdbheb>חָרַדְתְּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,13)\">2Kgs 4:13</ref>, <bdbheb>חָרְדוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,7)\">1Sam 13:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,15)\">1Sam 14:15</ref>, <bdbheb>וְחָֽרְדוּ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,16)\">Ezek 26:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,10)\">Ezek 32:10</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יֶחֱרַד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 37:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,1)\">Job 37:1</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיֶּחֱרַד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 27:33\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,33)\">Gen 27:33</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>יֶחְרְדוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 11:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,11,10)\">Hos 11:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,18)\">Ezek 26:18</ref>, <bdbheb>יֶחֶרְדוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 11:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,11,11)\">Hos 11:11</ref>, <bdbheb>יֶחֱרָ֑דוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 3:6\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,6)\">Amos 3:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 41:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,6)\">Isa 41:6</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיֶּחֶרְדוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 42:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,28)\">Gen 42:28</ref> + 2 t.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>חִרְדוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 32:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,11)\">Isa 32:11</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>tremble, quake</highlight>, of a mountain <ref ref=\"Exod 19:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,18)\">Exod 19:18</ref> — so HCT, but read <bdbheb>חָעָם</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); of isles <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,18)\">Ezek 26:18</ref> (metaphor, in fear); so <ref ref=\"Isa 41:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,5)\">Isa 41:5</ref> (<bdbheb>קְצוֺת הארץ</bdbheb>, || <bdbheb>אִיִּים יראו</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>tremble</highlight>, of persons under supernatural influence <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,15)\">1Sam 14:15</ref> (|| <bdbheb>חֲרָדֶה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>וַתִּרְגַּז הָאָרָץ</bdbheb>); <highlight>start, start up</highlight> (out of sleep) <ref ref=\"Ruth 3:8\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(8,3,8)\">Ruth 3:8</ref> in mental disturbance <ref ref=\"Gen 27:33\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,33)\">Gen 27:33</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; with accusative of congnate meaning with verb) <highlight>tremble</highlight>, in terror <ref ref=\"Exod 19:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,16)\">Exod 19:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Isa 32:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,11)\">Isa 32:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>רגז</bdbheb>), <highlight>be startled</highlight> (at sound of trumpet) <ref ref=\"Amos 3:6\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,6)\">Amos 3:6</ref> compare <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:49\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,49)\">1Kgs 1:49</ref> (+ <bdbheb>קום</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הלך</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>ירא</bdbheb>); <highlight>tremble</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,16)\">Ezek 26:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,10)\">Ezek 32:10</ref> followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> = <highlight>at</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Job 37:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,1)\">Job 37:1</ref> (<bdbheb>לִבִּי</bdbheb>), <highlight>be terrified</highlight>, of Egypt (personified) <ref ref=\"Isa 19:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,16)\">Isa 19:16</ref> (|| <bdbheb>פָּחַד</bdbheb>), Ramah <ref ref=\"Isa 10:29\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,29)\">Isa 10:29</ref>, of Saul <ref ref=\"1Sam 28:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,28,5)\">1Sam 28:5</ref> subject <bdbheb>לִבּוֺ</bdbheb>, || <bdbheb>ירא</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>be anxiously careful</highlight> <bdbheb>חָרַדְתְּ אֵלֵנוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אתכֿל הַחֲרָדָה הַזּאֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,13)\">2Kgs 4:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> with prepositions pregnantly = <highlight>go or come trembling</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,7)\">1Sam 13:7</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>מֵאחריו</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>) <ref ref=\"Gen 42:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,28)\">Gen 42:28</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; followed by <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,4)\">1Sam 16:4</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>לִקְרָאתוֺ</bdbheb>) so <ref ref=\"1Sam 21:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,21,2)\">1Sam 21:2</ref>, <ref ref=\"Hos 11:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,11,10)\">Hos 11:10</ref> (<bdbheb>מִיָּם</bdbheb>) v<ref ref=\"Hos 11:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,11,11)\">Hos 11:11</ref> (<bdbheb>מִמִּצְרַיִם</bdbheb>). <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>הֶחֱרִיד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 8:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,12)\">Judg 8:12</ref>, <bdbheb>וְּהַחֲרַדְתִּ֫י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,2)\">2Sam 17:2</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַחֲרִיד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:26\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,26)\">Lev 6:26</ref> + 11 t.; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הַחֲרִיד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,9)\">Ezek 30:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 2:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,2,4)\">Zech 2:4</ref> — <highlight>drive in terror, rout</highlight> an army, followed by accusative <ref ref=\"Judg 8:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,12)\">Judg 8:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,9)\">Ezek 30:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 2:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,2,4)\">Zech 2:4</ref> compare <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,2)\">2Sam 17:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> proposes <bdbheb>החרידו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 5:8\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,8)\">Hos 5:8</ref> <highlight>'setzt Benjamin in Schrecken,'</highlight> for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>אַחֲרֶיךָ</bdbheb>); in <highlight>Participle</highlight> absolute, only in <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְאֵין מ</bdbheb>; <highlight>and none shall terrify</highlight>, i.e. disturb the peace of those reposing — <bdbheb>שׁכב</bdbheb>,<bdbheb>שׁקט</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>רבץ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>ישׁב</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>ישׁב לָבֶטַחִ</bdbheb> — in the promised land <ref ref=\"Lev 26:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,6)\">Lev 26:6</ref>, so after captivity <ref ref=\"Jer 30:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,10)\">Jer 30:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 46:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,27)\">Jer 46:27</ref>, also <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,28)\">Ezek 34:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:26\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,26)\">Ezek 39:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 4:4\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,4)\">Mic 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:13\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,13)\">Zeph 3:13</ref> of undisturbed peace of the righteous <ref ref=\"Job 11:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,19)\">Job 11:19</ref> peace of flocks in forsaken cities <ref ref=\"Isa 17:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,17,2)\">Isa 17:2</ref> undisturbed feeding on carrion by fowl and beast <ref ref=\"Deut 28:26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,26)\">Deut 28:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 7:33\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,33)\">Jer 7:33</ref>, undisturbed prowling of lions <ref ref=\"Nah 2:12\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,12)\">Nah 2:12</ref> (metaphor of Assyrians). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 19:16", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Isa 10:29", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "2Kgs 4:13", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 4, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Sam 13:7", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 13, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Sam 14:15", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ezek 26:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 26, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ezek 32:10", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 32, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Job 37:1", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 37, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Gen 27:33", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 27, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Hos 11:10", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 11, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 26:18", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 26, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Hos 11:11", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 11, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Amos 3:6", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 3, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 41:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 41, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Gen 42:28", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 42, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Isa 32:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 32, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Exod 19:18", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 19, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Isa 41:5", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 41, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ruth 3:8", "book": "RUT", "chapter": 3, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Exod 19:16", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 19, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "1Kgs 1:49", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 1, "verse": 49}, {"raw": "1Sam 28:5", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 28, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Sam 16:4", "book": "1SA", 